Summary:
Today’s session involved initiating the frontend development for the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform. The focus was on setting up the React project and organizing the basic folder structure for components and pages. Initial work included creating simple UI layouts for key sections such as home, product listing, and navigation. The aim was to establish a clean and structured interface for further development.

Outcomes:
A functional React setup was successfully created with a clear project structure. Basic UI components and pages were developed to represent the core layout of the application. This step provided a strong starting point for building interactive features and connecting the frontend with the backend in the upcoming sessions.
